{
  "schema": 1,
  "status": "Pre-registered before any SP1 trace exists (2026-10-26). Patterns from the image source (vllm_exl3_moe/csrc, vllm v1 sample/spec_decode, offload/engram, offload/dspark); thresholds are decision rules, not results.",
  "kernel_rules_note": "Ordered: the first rule whose regex (Python re.search, case-sensitive) matches the GPU activity name wins; a bucket may appear in several rules. A name matching no rule is 'unmatched' and lowers coverage.",
